    "background_story": "Adam was born without arms, a rare congenital condition that would have daunted many. However, Adam's spirit was unbreakable. With the support of his loving family, he learned to adapt and overcome the challenges of everyday life. Adam developed an extraordinary ability to use his feet with precision, mastering tasks that others took for granted. He learned to write, type, and even play the piano with his toes. As he grew older, Adam became a motivational speaker, inspiring countless people with his resilience and determination. He proved that with the right mindset, anything is possible, and that disability is not inability. Adam's remarkable story serves as a testament to the human spirit's capacity to overcome adversity and achieve greatness.",
